==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use as much time as you need to prepare, since the startoff enemies are not much of a threat. When you're ready, attack the base. The Rain D. is not much of a threat due to its low magnification, so use midrangers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama]] to kill it. Do note that most of the akus that spawn on base hit will or can release death surges, so be prepared to replace your units frequently.

